# Stryker mutation testing — sandbox copies and the HTML report. mutation-summary.json (the
# dashboard's coverage-of-test-quality input, src/failure-analysis/mutation-summary.ts) is
# committed on purpose — mutation.yml is path-filtered and runs separately from regression.yml
# (which builds the dashboard) and master's branch protection blocks a direct push from CI anyway,
# so a human/PR commits the refreshed snapshot instead of an automated write-back.
.stryker-tmp/
reports/*
!reports/mutation-summary.json
